[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナちゃん……大丈夫かな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I hope Izana's okay..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫だ。余が会ったときはピンピンしていた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's fine. She was perfectly healthy when I saw her."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そうですよね！\u3000大丈夫ですよね！\n武運長久、とこしえに健やかで……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "R-right! She's fine! May fortune favor her... Now and always...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "混乱、しているみたいですね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She seems... confused."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "心配も分からんでもないが……\nあやつらもついているし、問題なかろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I understand your concern, but... she has companions with her. There should be no issue."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふぅ……お、重い……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oof... S-so heavy...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナちゃん！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ……ごめんね、心配かけて。\nそれに、本当のこと言えないで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah... Sorry for worrying you. And for not being able to tell you the truth."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当のこと？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The truth?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは私たちの口から説明しましょう。\n彼女たちはお疲れでしょうから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Allow us to explain. These young ladies must be exhausted."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "上手くいったようだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Seems like things went well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？\u3000えっ？\u3000火事で人を助けたんだよ、ね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Wait, you rescued people from the fire, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "実はね、アタシの任務はこのお店の\n不正を暴くことだったんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Actually, my real mission was to expose the shop's illegal activities."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さっき救出した支配人さんが、\n星誕祭のプレゼントを盗んだ犯人だったなんて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can't believe the manager we rescued was the one stealing all those Star Festival presents..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こうして取り押さえられたし、売上金も確保した。\n盗難被害者の補填に当てられるだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now that he's been apprehended and the stolen funds secured, we should be able to compensate the victims."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えー！\u3000じゃああたしの給料は！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait! What about my wages?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "テス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tess"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "雇われていた店員は盗難を知らなかったんですから\nちゃんと給料は払われますよ。安心してください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The employees weren't aware of the theft, so you'll still be paid. Don't worry."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ俺らの借金も！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What about our debt?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは働いて返済する必要があるだろうが……\nまあ、借金分は働いたのではないか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That you'll need to work off... Though I'd say you've already put in the effort."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やっと……借金返済生活、終了でござりまするか……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "At last... our life of debt slavery is over...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "フン、余が知らぬうちに借金だけでなくこのような\n面白き事態にも首を突っ込んでおったとはな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph. Not only did you rack up debt without my knowledge, but you got yourselves mixed up in something this interesting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お二人も、無事でなによりです……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm just glad you're both safe..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "逃がしてしまっては元も子もないので\nあまり情報を公開できず、申し訳ありません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We couldn't risk letting him escape, so we had to keep things confidential. My apologies."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "元はといえば、クリセルダが一人で調べてて……\n危ないから、私もついてったの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda started investigating alone... I followed because it was dangerous..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "盗難騒ぎですぐに犯人の目星はついていたのだけど、\n上前をかすめ取るには儲けが少なくてね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'd already identified the culprit behind the thefts, but the profit margin wasn't worth skimming from."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "王国も気付いたのなら、そちらに恩を売って\nおいた方が上策と踏んだまでよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Once the kingdom caught on, I figured it would be more advantageous to earn their favor instead."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うむ、真であるな。為政者は何よりも面子や\n恩義を重んじるもの……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. Rulers value reputation and favors above all else..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "仮釈放中……観察処分の身であることを\n念頭に動いてもらいたいものだがな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'd appreciate it if you kept in mind that you're on probation... under observation."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。王国の監察もなかなか厳しいこと、\n今回の案件で骨身に染みたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. This case really drove home just how strict the kingdom's surveillance can be."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今度から気を付けましょう。ね、アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll be more careful next time. Right, Antje?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う、うん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yeah..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まったく懲りない悪びれない……\n胃が痛くなりますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Completely shameless... My stomach hurts."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ワルター殿も大変そうでござりまするな。\n拙者の胃薬でよければお分けいたしまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Master Walther seems to be having a tough time. If you'd like, I can share some of my stomach medicine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "冷たいね、夜の風",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The night air is cold."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ん、そだね。",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yeah, it is."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃん、さっきも言ったけど、ごめんね。\n本当のこと言えなくて、振り回しちゃって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna, I said it before, but I'm sorry. For not telling you the truth. For dragging you around."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん、大丈夫。\nぜんぜん気にしてないよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, it's fine. I'm not bothered at all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何か事情があるんだろうなっていうのは\n分かってたもん。それにイザナちゃんのことは信じてる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I knew there had to be some reason. Besides, I trust you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "騎士のお仕事は秘密の任務とかもあるよね。\n仕方のないことだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Knight work involves secret missions and stuff, right? It couldn't be helped."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そっか。でも、それだけじゃないよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I guess. But that's not the only reason."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナ、ちゃん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃんは……\nレスナちゃんだけは巻き込みたくなかったの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I... I didn't want to get you involved."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だって、ずっと前から星誕祭のお菓子の発注請けて\n頑張って作るぞって張り切ってたの見てたし……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You'd been working so hard on that candy order for the Star Festival, getting all excited about it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃんには何も知らず、ただ純粋に\n星誕祭を楽しんでもらいたかったんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wanted you to enjoy the festival purely, without knowing anything."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だからね、余計言い出せなくて。\nさっさと言っちゃったほうが安心したかもしれないのに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's why I couldn't bring myself to say anything. Maybe it would've been easier if I'd just told you right away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ……考えすぎだよ。それに、その調子じゃ\nイザナちゃんのが純粋に楽しめてなかったんじゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe... You're overthinking it. Besides, sounds like you're the one who couldn't enjoy the festival purely."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私こそ、ごめんね。実は星誕祭の間、\nちょっと不安だったんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry too, actually. To be honest, I was a little anxious during the festival."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナちゃんが他の人たちと話してて、\nそこに入れないで……遠くに行っちゃったのかもって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Seeing you talking with everyone else, unable to join in... I worried you might be drifting away from me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなことないよ！\u3000アタシが帰る場所は\nいつだって、ここ。レスナちゃんの隣だよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's not true! The place I return to will always be here. Right beside you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……ありがと！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... Thanks!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
